@startuml
actor Customer
usecase Checkout
(Pay)
Customer --> Checkout
Checkout ..> Pay : <<include>>
note right of Customer : a registered\nshopper
note left of Checkout
  must be
  logged in
end note
note "PCI scope" as N
N .. Pay
note bottom of (Pay) #LightGreen : card or wallet
Customer --> Pay
note on link : direct
@enduml
